[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 10980.15, "timestamp": "03:03:00", "text": "有些事，就像我要回去一样。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10982.19, "timestamp": "03:03:02", "text": "向前"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10995.99, "timestamp": "03:03:15", "text": "等等，我刚才说到哪儿了？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10999.429, "timestamp": "03:03:19", "text": "是的，某种程度上我会停止骚扰你。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11001.67, "timestamp": "03:03:21", "text": "但不管怎样，我们开始进入……"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11005.59, "timestamp": "03:03:25", "text": "因为我忙于各种事情，所以没法录视频。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11008.469, "timestamp": "03:03:28", "text": "有时候会看DC漫画或者动漫。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11010.19, "timestamp": "03:03:30", "text": "我"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11011.87, "timestamp": "03:03:31", "text": "也"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11014.19, "timestamp": "03:03:34", "text": "感同身受。是的，我也很想念你们。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11016.63, "timestamp": "03:03:36", "text": "人们开始做 YouTube 视频。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11018.389, "timestamp": "03:03:38", "text": "因为他们会专注于自己的事情。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11027.67, "timestamp": "03:03:47", "text": "但愿我能抽出时间来"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11030.87, "timestamp": "03:03:50", "text": "过来看看你的直播什么的"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11036.349, "timestamp": "03:03:56", "text": "[音乐]"}]